cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CreativityPrism, please cite the paper below."
title: "CreativityPrism: A Cross-Domain Evaluation Framework for Large Language Model Creativity"
abstract: >-
  A cross-domain benchmark for large language model creativity, spanning eight
  tasks across divergent thinking, creative writing, mathematical creativity,
  code creativity, and originality measurement.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
